---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../../components/Breadcrumb.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy — Valore Agency';
const description = 'Personal data processing policy of the Valore Agency website.';
const canonical = 'https://valoreagency.net/en/privacy-policy/';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical}>
  <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/en/' }, { label: 'Privacy policy' }]} />

  <section class="prose">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="section-title">Privacy policy</h1>
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy sets out how personal data of users of the website valoreagency.net
        (the “Website”), owned by Valore Agency (the “Operator”), is processed.
      </p>

      <h2>1. What data we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you fill in forms on the Website (a consultation request, a service order), we may
        collect your name, phone number, email address and the content of your message. The Website
        may also collect anonymized technical data — device type, browser, and the pages you
        visited.
      </p>

      <h2>2. How we use the data</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To contact you about your request</li>
        <li>To prepare a commercial proposal or a consultation</li>
        <li>To improve the Website</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not share or sell your personal data to third parties, except as required by the laws of the Russian Federation.</p>

      <h2>3. Data storage and protection</h2>
      <p>
        Personal data is stored for as long as necessary to achieve the purposes of processing, or
        until consent is withdrawn. We take reasonable organizational and technical measures to
        protect data from unauthorized access.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        The Website may use cookies for forms to work correctly, for traffic analytics and to
        remember your choice of language version. You can disable cookies in your browser
        settings — this may affect some Website features.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You have the right to request information about what data of yours the Operator stores and
        to demand that it be corrected or deleted. To do so, contact us using the details on the
        “Contact” page.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        The Operator reserves the right to change this Policy. The current version is always
        available on this page.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
